 ScenarioE;tids;t0;ok;result
⍝ ── E — Livelock (two locks) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
⍝ The non-blocking retry avoids the deadlock but makes no progress: the two flows
⍝ collide every round and retry forever, with no error to warn you. Each asks for 10
⍝ bookings. The harness gives the pair one second and counts completions (DONE). A
⍝ livelock is easy to miss, because nothing signals the stall; only the count shows it.
 NewSeats 1000
 DONE←0
 tids←(ReserveRetrySP&10),(ReserveRetryPS&10)
 t0←3⊃⎕AI
 :While ∨/tids∊⎕TNUMS
     {}⎕DL 0.02
     :If 1<0.001×(3⊃⎕AI)-t0 ⋄ :Leave ⋄ :EndIf
 :EndWhile
 {}⎕TKILL tids
 ok←DONE≥3
 result←'FAIL' 'PASS'⊃⍨⎕IO+ok
 ⎕←'E livelock    : bookings in 1s = ',⍕DONE
 ⎕←'Scenario E: ',result
